        "Description": "POWERFUL: Powered by commercial grade 26cc, 2-cycle full crank gas powered engine which is environmentally friendly by reducing emissions, increasing fuel efficiency and delivering longer life 2-IN-1 MULTI-FUNCTION TOOL: includes 26cc power head, grass trimmer attachment for detail work along borders, a brush cutter blade with a 17-inch cutting swath for heavier grasses and brush clearing and shoulder harness to relieve the strain on your arms and improve stability. ENVIRONMENTALLY FRIENDLY: Full crank design delivers a fast start and smooth operation reducing emissions, increasing fuel efficiency and delivering longer run time EASY TO START AND COMFORTABLE OPERATION: Engine starts within 5 pulls, tool-free air filter and transmission is supported by a vented aluminum casing which greatly reduces vibration allowing you to work in comfort until the job is done COMPATIBLE WITH THE FOLLOWING: Works with most brands of attachment-capable trimmers like Sunseeker, Wild Badger Power, Ryobi, Craftsman, Troy-Bilt, Toro, Poulan, Poulan Pro, Weed Eater, Cub Cadet, MTD Pro, John Deer, Yard Machine, Yard Man, McCulloch - Note: Be sure to check your user manual before purchasing for this attachment for another brand, Female- shaft diameter 1 inch, square inner diameter .48 inch, Male- shaft diameter 1 inch, square diameter .4 inch COMFORT HANDLES: Includes comfort rubber vibration dampened handle and P-handle with foam for comfortable use",
